  "question": {
    "text": "Two sound waves having the same wavelength <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math>&nbsp;and same frequency but with intensities <math><mn>9</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;are interfering. When the path difference between the waves is&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;the resulting intensity is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>nI</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math>?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "13",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></msqrt><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>"
